Package: zola
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kaysarjan Kasim <ceaser.k.w@outlook.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Codex provider manager and local proxy
 Zola manages Codex providers, writes Codex configuration, and can run a
 local proxy that translates and forwards Responses or Chat Completions
 requests to an OpenAI-compatible provider.

